{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Because he sought to seduce you.</b> Even though he did not cause the harm that the seducers of a wayward city cause, he is nevertheless liable to death because he sought to seduce you — and by executing him you will achieve that he seduce no others. And if you do not put him to death, perhaps he or another will seduce others, and their blood will be on your hands."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:21:22.304038211Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}